								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							For the second time my account gets hacked or taken or whatever the hell folks call a stolen account.<br /><br />A bunch of people probably know me as Brox, well that account got hacked and some fucker did some messed up shit while I was away. Needless to say, people now hate me and I am now banned without any warning. Of course, this being as messed up as it is (the second time I was hacked in the past 30 or so days) I&#039;m just going to give up on this, I posted this under rants cause the cussing here is inevitable due to the level of pissed-the-fuck-off that I am at. You folks can try to pry some drama from this post if you can. Will see most of you hopefully in WoW and no, I&#039;m not going to give anyone all my platinum.<br /><br />Good Journey for the last time folks, <br />Brox/Aeneron
						</td>
					</tr>
