							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							no plats?&nbsp; &nbsp;<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/dissappointed.gif" alt="dissappointed" border="0" />&nbsp; what about loots?&nbsp; Can I have all your stuff?&nbsp; &nbsp;<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/cool.gif" alt="Cool" border="0" /><br /><br />Who are you giving your account information to?&nbsp; &quot;Hacks&quot; are almost always the result of giving out account information to someone who gives it to someone else or abuses it themselves.&nbsp; The other way it happens is sending your account information in private messages on message boards.&nbsp; PMs on my boards are easily hacked.&nbsp; Don&#039;t send out account information.&nbsp; Period.<br />
